@title Schematic: EMC net classes (wire colours, tags, legend, wire card, set class), dark and light
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Ctrl+K "EMC net classes" (View menu) colours each wire of the page by its cable class and tags it with the class word; the panel counts the classes and the card of a picked wire says why it has its class.
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text open emc example
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
key PageDown
wait 8
key PageDown
wait 12
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc net classes
wait 8
key Enter
wait 20
expect "EMC net classes"
expect "not a test result"
shot nets-dark
check_layout
# Keeping one class in colour steps the others back.
click_text "Motor and drive output" #1
wait 10
shot nets-motor-focus
click_text "Motor and drive output" #1
wait 10
# The light look.
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 10
expect "EMC net classes"
shot nets-light
check_layout
